 is an excellent choice.Whether you're looking to unwind or sharpen your reflexes through deliberate practice, this game delivers just the right level of feedback.", "short_description": "This is an engaging, fast-paced point accumulation game.The core experience revolves around speed and judgment, continuously testing your reaction time.Each level presents an intriguing challenge, requiring players to track moving targets amidst shifting rhythms."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liuyifei1228.github.io/VRGames/OneArmedMillionaire/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "unity", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://liuyifei1228.github.io/VRGames/OneArmedMillionaire/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35035585546088881"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1277725157892085_7682882915329448935_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l4axgOR9PRYQ7kNvwF10FV4&_nc_oc=AdocNZ_CZHNapxkr5Y1SVAxSCwfYk9WjQM_ydafmRfPh1PYoGR3WPrZ9c4l4qXxGIWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_zXDlHSc9KQbIcWM6PDg8EN5_B9QsLri-WRp2GmWlZA&oe=6AFDCD3B"}, "i